aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.speaker=Race Attendant
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.body=Ready to climb? Joining costs ten gold coins. Wait for friends, then start when everyone is set.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.c_join=Join the race (10 gold)
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.c_leave=Leave the race
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.c_start=Start the race
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.c_leaderboard=Look at the leaderboard
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.c_about=How does the climb work?
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.main_hub.c_goodbye=Goodbye

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.about.body=Joining costs ten gold coins. When everyone who wants to climb has joined, start the race. You move to a start spot and the timer begins. Stand on the pink crystal at the very top to finish. Climbs of thirteen seconds or faster earn the most summer festival tickets. Slower than seventeen seconds earns none. Leave before the race starts and you get your gold back. Only one race runs at a time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.about.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.joined.body=You are in! Tell me when you want to start, or wait for friends to join. Leave before we start and I will give your gold back.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.joined.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.join_failed.body=I cannot add you right now. The race may be full or already going.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.join_failed.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.join_need_gold.body=Joining costs ten gold coins. Come back when you can pay.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.join_need_gold.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.left.body=You left the race. I returned your gold. Come back when you are ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.left.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.race_started.body=Go! Climb to the pink crystal at the top. Your timer is running.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.race_started.c_go=On my way!

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.start_failed.body=I cannot start the race yet. Join first, and wait until no other race is going.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.start_failed.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.race_busy.body=A race is already going. Wait until everyone finishes, then you can join the next one.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_tree_climb_attendant.race_busy.c_back=Back
